/// M03 CORE-001 "bundled arrays: roots green, silent run".
/// Source: tests/integration/arrays_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledArrays.
/// Related fixtures: compiler/testdata/current/arrays/main.can (46 roots)
/// and contracts.can (28 roots); ground for every count pin below.
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with passed reports and
/// exactly 46 main roots plus 28 contracts roots grounded per operation
/// group and per fixture name, silent production run (exit 0, empty
/// stdout, empty stderr, both fixtures).
/// Per-operation order/alias/immutability/scheduling/failure-stop facets
/// live in core-001-array-semantics.can; callback failure, owner context,
/// thenable/getter hostility, native delegation, staged traces and the
/// conditional tsc leg live in core-001-hostile-production.can.
/// Variants: main fixture (46 roots), contracts fixture (28 roots).
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_TSC/CAN_BUN gate the optional
/// strict tsc leg (pinned conditional in the hostile file). Logical gates
/// SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23).
/// Case bundled/arrays-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// main-count, contracts-count, main-fixture, contracts-fixture,
/// main-helpers, main-map, main-search, main-fold, main-sort-copy,
/// main-append, main-entry, contracts-capture, contracts-protected,
/// contracts-failure, contracts-schedule, contracts-sort,
/// contracts-owner, contracts-entry, run-silent.
/// Facet map (arrays_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L80-83: exit 0, empty stderr, both fixtures); report-passed pins the
/// report leg (L84-87: passed true); main-count/contracts-count pin the
/// row counts (L71-74, L85: 46 and 28 assertions);
/// main-fixture/contracts-fixture pin the staged names main.can and
/// contracts.can; main-helpers pins twice/selected/add/observe/identity
/// (main.can L9/16/23/31/38: 1 each = 5); main-map pins mapped 2
/// (L45-46) plus generic_map, referenced_map, referenced_reverse,
/// spread_map, nested_spread_map, empty_generic_map, direct_empty,
/// empty_generic_spread, empty_bound_concat 1 each = 11; main-search
/// pins filtered, found, any, all, referenced_find 2 each = 10;
/// main-fold pins folded and visited 2 each plus empty_generic_fold and
/// empty_append_fold 1 each = 6; main-sort-copy pins sorted and copied 2
/// each = 4; main-append pins referenced_slice 2 plus referenced_append,
/// inferred_append, direct_append, generic_add, spread_concat,
/// spread_append, spread_slice 1 each = 9; main-entry pins main (L253:
/// empty args to ok); contracts-capture pins noop, identity, add_near,
/// echo 1 each = 4; contracts-protected pins captured, generic_bound,
/// protected_payloads, accumulate, protected_fold 1 each = 5;
/// contracts-failure pins fallible 2 plus stops, referenced_stops,
/// quotient, standard_stop 1 each = 6; contracts-schedule pins source,
/// queued, mapped_queue, concurrent_queue 1 each = 4; contracts-sort
/// pins immutable_copies, sort_key, stable_sort, nonfinite_sort 1 each =
/// 4; contracts-owner pins once, spread_once, map, nominal_map 1 each =
/// 4; contracts-entry pins main (L213: empty args to ok); run-silent
/// pins the run leg (L88-91: exit 0, empty stdout, empty stderr, both
/// fixtures).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
